# secrets stay out of the build context, as they stay out of git (.gitignore); the release's keys
# come in as build secrets (Dockerfile, https://docs.docker.com/build/building/secrets/)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# native build output, which the image never uses (one-client-platform-d.md, D3): the desktop app's
# Rust target, the client's prebuilt projects (expo prebuild; never committed, .gitignore) and its
# desktop and mock exports. packages/native/ios and packages/brand/assets/icons/ios are source, so
# only these exact paths are left out
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
apps/client/ios
apps/client/android
**/.expo
**/dist-desktop
**/dist-mock
**/.dist-mock-*
